OL,3,AUK net migration falls to 77,000 in
OL,4,Ayear to June 2026 - lowest since 1997,
OL,5,Aoutside pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FUK net migration fell to 77,000 in the
OL,8,Fyear to June 2026, the lowest it's been
OL,9,Fsince 1997 apart from in the Covid
OL,10,Fpandemic
OL,12,FThe fall was mainly driven by fewer
OL,13,Fpeople from outside Europe coming to
OL,14,Fthe UK, data from the Office for
OL,15,FNational Statistics shows
OL,17,FHenry Zeffman analysis: This is a big
OL,18,Fmoment and it's likely to be attributed
OL,19,Fto measures taken under the Tories -
OL,20,Fbut Labour will argue they've achieved
OL,21,Fin two years what their predecessors
OL,22,Fcouldn't in 14
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
