OL,3,AUK net migration falls to 77,000 in
OL,4,Ayear to June 2026 - lowest since 1997,
OL,5,Aoutside pandemic
OL,6,
OL,7,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says the
OL,8,Fgovernment has "restored control" in
OL,9,Fbringing net migration down 92% from
OL,10,Fits 2023 peak; shadow home secretary
OL,11,FChris Philp says people are leaving the
OL,12,FUK "because of Labour's high taxes
OL,13,Fwhilst non-EU immigration remains far
OL,14,Ftoo high"
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Home Office figures show the
OL,17,Fnumber of people claiming asylum in the
OL,18,FUK dropped by a third in the year
OL,19,Fending September 2026 - but appeals are
OL,20,Fon the rise
